{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-23",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "截图留证的规矩  (Screenshots and House Rules)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Across the café table, Kaiwen lays out the evidence Xingtian saved of the commentators' pre-written hit piece and states the ground rules for ever working with Chun Yuqiao's team again. Listen to Kaiwen in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上一期文娱论录制的时候，这篇新闻出现了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "详细描写了二位在节目录制前一分钟真诚和解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "并且异口同声指责星天现场服务不佳。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这篇奇闻上线不到几分钟就被删了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那天要不是总编室给二位吃了闭门羹，早就传遍网络了吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "原文虽然删了，但就在那几分钟里已经有人截了图。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们已经把虚假报道上线又删除的整件事写成了文章。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "只等淳于总一声令下，稿子就发。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "大家都是圈里人，想要借着星天的平台炒炒热度，没问题的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但想要合作，必须先和淳于总商量好了然后再干。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你们搞偷袭，拿我们总编室当什么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "星天不会让损人利己的人占到半毛钱便宜，现在都明白了吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上一期文娱论录制的时候，这篇新闻出现了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'While the previous episode of Entertainment Talk was taping, this news article went up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "详细描写了二位在节目录制前一分钟真诚和解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It described in detail how the two of you sincerely reconciled one minute before taping.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "并且异口同声指责星天现场服务不佳。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And how with one voice you blamed Xingtian for poor studio service.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这篇奇闻上线不到几分钟就被删了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That bizarre article was deleted within minutes of going online.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那天要不是总编室给二位吃了闭门羹，早就传遍网络了吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Had the chief editor's office not shut the door on your recording that day, it would have spread across the internet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "原文虽然删了，但就在那几分钟里已经有人截了图。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Although the original post was deleted, someone already took screenshots during those few minutes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们已经把虚假报道上线又删除的整件事写成了文章。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have already written up the whole affair of that fake report going live and getting scrubbed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "只等淳于总一声令下，稿子就发。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One word from Mr Chun Yuqiao and our article goes out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "大家都是圈里人，想要借着星天的平台炒炒热度，没问题的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are all in the industry; wanting to use Xingtian's platform for a bit of buzz is fine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但想要合作，必须先和淳于总商量好了然后再干。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet if you want to cooperate, you must talk it through with Mr Chun Yuqiao first before acting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你们搞偷袭，拿我们总编室当什么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pulling a sneak attack—what did you take our chief editor's office for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "星天不会让损人利己的人占到半毛钱便宜，现在都明白了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian will never let self-serving schemers gain half a cent at our expense—is everything clear now?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上一期文娱论录制的时候，这篇新闻出现了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "详细描写了二位在节目录制前一分钟真诚和解。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "并且异口同声指责星天现场服务不佳。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这篇奇闻上线不到几分钟就被删了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那天要不是总编室给二位吃了闭门羹，早就传遍网络了吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "原文虽然删了，但就在那几分钟里已经有人截了图。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们已经把虚假报道上线又删除的整件事写成了文章。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "只等淳于总一声令下，稿子就发。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "大家都是圈里人，想要借着星天的平台炒炒热度，没问题的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但想要合作，必须先和淳于总商量好了然后再干。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你们搞偷袭，拿我们总编室当什么了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "星天不会让损人利己的人占到半毛钱便宜，现在都明白了吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Armed with undeniable screenshots, Kaiwen settles the commentators' stunt in minutes without firing a single public shot. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
